InvalidSyntax

  x An unparenthesized `as` or `satisfies` expression cannot be followed by an operator that would bind differently after type erasure
   ,-[1:1]
 1 | 1 + 1 as any satisfies number / 2;
   :                               ^
 2 | 2 ** 3 satisfies any as number ** 2;
   `----
InvalidSyntax

  x An unparenthesized `as` or `satisfies` expression cannot be followed by an operator that would bind differently after type erasure
   ,-[2:1]
 1 | 1 + 1 as any satisfies number / 2;
 2 | 2 ** 3 satisfies any as number ** 2;
   :                                ^^
   `----
